    "# 已验证的 IP-Adapter 人物参考图流程（2026-11-23）\n",
    "\n",
    "本 Notebook 的实验环境已在 Kaggle 免费 T4 x2 会话中验证：CUDA 可用，检测到两张 Tesla T4。工作目录中已有 AnythingV5 SD1.5 Diffusers 模型和 `h94/IP-Adapter` 的 `ip-adapter_sd15_light.safetensors` 与 image encoder 缓存。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 已验证步骤\n",
    "- AnythingV5 以 `torch_dtype=torch.float16, variant=\"fp16\"` 从本地缓存加载成功。\n",
    "- `pipe.disable_attention_slicing()` 后，`pipe.load_ip_adapter(..., subfolder=\"models\", weight_name=\"ip-adapter_sd15_light.safetensors\", image_encoder_folder=\"image_encoder\")` 加载成功。\n",
